  "stage1Title": "The Fern Trail",
  "stage1Blurb": "Gecko scouts guard the way into the deep jungle.",
  "stage2Title": "Canopy Bridge",
  "stage2Blurb": "A wobbly rope bridge high in the treetops, and the fastest skinks on the island.",
  "stage3Title": "Misty Swamp",
  "stage3Blurb": "Cold fog, black water and iguanas with icy scales.",
  "stage4Title": "Lake Snapjaw",
  "stage4Blurb": "Cross the lake on a raft while crocodiles circle below.",
  "stage5Title": "Temple of Scales",
  "stage5Blurb": "Chameleon priests who change colour mid-fight.",
  "stage6Title": "Serpent Gorge",
  "stage6Blurb": "A canyon full of snakes in every colour.",
  "stage7Title": "Throne of Scales",
  "stage7Blurb": "King Komo awaits. A pushup duel for the jungle's respect.",
  "s1i1": "Welcome to the deep jungle, Carlos! Stay close. This is lizard country.",
  "s1i2": "HALT! No apes past the ferns. King Komo's orders!",
  "s1i3": "I just want to find my friends…",
  "s1i4": "Then you'll have to get through us! Geckos, ATTACK!",
  "s1i5": "Green lizards hate steady, honest pushups. Show them your form!",
  "s1o1": "Ow… okay, okay! You're stronger than you look, ape.",
  "s1o2": "But the King will never let you cross his jungle!",
  "s2i1": "This rope bridge is the only way through the treetops.",
  "s2i2": "Hehe, too slow, big guy! Nobody's faster than the Skink Squad!",
  "s2i3": "Yellow skinks dodge slow moves. Do your pushups quickly, one after another!",
  "s2i4": "Fast hands. Here we go!",
  "s2o1": "Whoa… you're actually fast! A gecko buddy wants to ride along with you.",
  "s3i1": "Brrr… this swamp is cold enough to freeze my feathers.",
  "s3i2": "Ssslow down, ape. Our icy scales crack only under patient strength.",
  "s3i3": "Blue lizards! Hold each pushup at the bottom for two seconds!",
  "s3o1": "Impressive patience… Take this. Jade suits a hero of the jungle.",
  "s4i1": "The King's throne lies across Lake Snapjaw. Hop on the raft!",
  "s4i2": "Pushups… on a boat? Sure, why not.",
  "s4i3": "Ahoy, hairy! These are MY waters. Nobody crosses without a fight!",
  "s4i4": "Watch their colours, Carlos. Every croc needs a different move!",
  "s4o1": "Arr… you rowed us all into submission. Keep this tooth, sailor.",
  "s5i1": "The Temple of Scales! The lizards worship the Great Shed Skin here.",
  "s5i2": "Welcome, pilgrim… or should I say, VICTIM?",
  "s5i3": "Chameleons change colour! Watch closely and switch your pushups to match.",
  "s5i4": "Steady, hold, quick… got it. I think.",
  "s5o1": "You see through every disguise. Wear these eyes, and see like we do.",
  "s6i1": "Sssso… the ape made it to my gorge. Nobody passesss.",
  "s6i2": "Snakes of every colour… This is the last stop before the throne!",
  "s6i3": "For the Banana Brigade!",
  "s6o1": "Sssplendid fighting. Take my spare tail… you'll need it where you're going.",
  "s7i1": "So. The famous ape who out-pushed my whole kingdom.",
  "s7i2": "My people lived here a thousand years before the first banana grew. Why should I share it with you?",
  "s7i3": "I'm not here to take it. I just want my friends back… and a home for all of us.",
  "s7i4": "Words are cheap. In this kingdom, respect is earned one pushup at a time.",
  "s7i5": "A pushup duel. Rep for rep. Win, and you'll have my respect.",
  "s7p2": "Not bad! But can you HOLD your ground?",
  "s7p3": "Enough! Let's see how FAST you really are!",
  "s7o1": "…I yield. You fight with honour, Carlos.",
  "s7o2": "The jungle is yours to share. And if you'll have me… I'd love to see that island of yours.",
  "s7o3": "Welcome to the team, Your Majesty!",
  "s7o4": "A gorilla and a lizard king, best friends. Now I've seen everything!",
