  "q1Title": "Mount Burpee's Hiccups",
  "q1Teaser": "The volcano has the hiccups and is sneezing lava on Coco's nest. Only super fast pushups can scare them away.",
  "q1i1": "CARLOS! Code red! Mount Burpee has the hiccups!",
  "q1i2": "Volcanoes get hiccups?!",
  "q1i3": "Every time it hics, it sneezes lava on my nest. Rude.",
  "q1i4": "Legend says only a gorilla doing super fast pushups can scare hiccups away.",
  "q1i5": "Fast pushups? I was BORN for this.",
  "q1i6": "Ten pushups in thirty seconds. Go fast. Go furious. Go… banana.",
  "q1w1": "It worked! The volcano burped out… a message in a bottle?!",
  "q1w2": "\"We're out there. Keep growing the island. — The Banana Brigade.\" My friends are alive!",
  "q1l1": "…hic. Still hiccuping. My poor nest.",
  "q1l2": "I'll be back tomorrow, faster than ever!",
  "q2Title": "The Wishing Moon",
  "q2Teaser": "Sir Shelldon says the full moon grants a wish to whoever holds their pushups slow and strong.",
  "q2i1": "Ahh… young Carlos… tonight… is the night… of the Wishing Moon…",
  "q2i2": "Sir Shelldon! Are you… awake?",
  "q2i3": "I have been awake… since 1824.",
  "q2i4": "The moon grants one wish… to whoever holds their pushups… slow… and strong… like a tortoise.",
  "q2i5": "Then I wish to find my monkey friends!",
  "q2i6": "Hold each pushup at the bottom… three seconds. Five times. The moon… is watching.",
  "q2w1": "The moon smiles… Look… its reflection draws a map… east… beyond the reef.",
  "q2w2": "A map to my friends! I'll need a bigger island to get there…",
  "q2l1": "Patience… even the moon… took four billion years… Return tomorrow.",
  "q3Title": "Jag's Banana Bet",
  "q3Teaser": "A show-off jaguar guards the Golden Banana and bets you can't do 20 pushups on his temple steps. Double bananas if you do.",
  "q3i1": "Well, well. The famous Carlos. I hear you do… pushups.",
  "q3i2": "And who are you supposed to be?",
  "q3i3": "Jag. Fastest cat, biggest biceps, guardian of the Golden Banana.",
  "q3i4": "I bet you can't do 20 pushups on my temple steps. Win, and I double your bananas.",
  "q3i5": "Deal. Prepare to be out-pushed, kitty.",
  "q3w1": "…Twenty. Fine. FINE. Take your double bananas.",
  "q3w2": "Also… a monkey in a cape came through last week. Said she was looking for a gorilla.",
  "q3w3": "A monkey in a cape?! That has to be Lulu!",
  "q3l1": "Ha! The Golden Banana stays with me. Come back when you have muscles.",
  "q4Title": "The Rainbow Bridge",
  "q4Teaser": "An island is floating in the sky! The rainbow bridge up runs on muscle power: every pushup paints a stripe.",
  "q4i1": "Carlos, look up! An island… IN THE SKY!",
  "q4i2": "How do we get up there? I can't fly!",
  "q4i3": "The rainbow bridge runs on muscle power. Every pushup paints a stripe.",
  "q4i4": "Fifteen pushups, fifteen stripes. Let's paint the sky!",
  "q4w1": "We made it! Whoa, there's a tiny footprint up here… with a banana sticker on it.",
  "q4w2": "That's Lulu's sticker! She was HERE!",
  "q4l1": "The bridge faded… We need more stripes. Same time tomorrow?",
  "q5Title": "The Masked Monkey",
  "q5Teaser": "Someone in sunglasses is waiting on the beach at night. They say they know where your friends are.",
  "q5i1": "Psst. Gorilla. Over here.",
  "q5i2": "Who's there? And why are you wearing sunglasses at night?",
  "q5i3": "Because I'm cool. And undercover. The Banana Brigade sent me.",
  "q5i4": "They can't come back until the island is ready for everyone. Keep building. Keep pushing.",
  "q5i5": "Twelve pushups before the tide comes in, and I'll double today's bananas.",
  "q5w1": "Not bad, big guy. I'll tell them you're getting swole.",
  "q5w2": "Wait! Lulu, is that you?! …She's gone.",
  "q5l1": "Too slow, big guy. The tide waits for no one.",
  "cheerCoco1": "SQUAWK! Faster!",
  "cheerCoco2": "You got this!",
  "cheerCoco3": "Pump it, Carlos!",
  "cheerShelldon1": "Sloooow… and strong…",
  "cheerShelldon2": "Breathe… young one…",
  "cheerJag1": "Is that all?",
  "cheerJag2": "Pfft. Lucky rep.",
  "cheerJag3": "…Not bad.",
  "cheerStranger1": "Keep it up, big guy.",
  "cheerStranger2": "The Brigade is watching.",
  "cheerReptile1": "Get off our island!",
  "cheerReptile2": "Hisss!",
  "cheerReptile3": "Is that all you've got, ape?",
